#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Credential Vault"
msgstr "Vault ya Vitambulisho"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Vault Key File"
msgstr "Faili ya Ufunguo wa Vault"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to the 32-byte key that encrypts stored credentials. Create it yourself, outside the web root, readable only by the web server and poller user, in a directory that only root and that user can write (the same applies to credential files); the plugin never creates or writes it. Back it up with the database: without it, stored credentials must be entered again."
msgstr "Njia kamili ya ufunguo wa baiti 32 unaosimba vitambulisho vilivyohifadhiwa. Iunde mwenyewe, nje ya mzizi wa wavuti, ikiwa inaweza kusomwa na seva ya wavuti na mtumiaji wa poller pekee, katika saraka ambayo root na mtumiaji huyo pekee ndio wanaoweza kuandika (hali kadhalika kwa faili za vitambulisho); programu-jalizi kamwe haiundi au kuiandika. Ihifadhi nakala pamoja na hifadhidata: bila hiyo, vitambulisho vilivyohifadhiwa lazima viwekwe tena."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Credential File Directory"
msgstr "Saraka ya Faili za Vitambulisho"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to the directory that holds credential files. An account can read its credential from a file only inside it, never the vault key file. Empty, the default, refuses credential files. Cloud Admin chooses the file, so keep only cloud credentials here."
msgstr "Njia kamili ya saraka inayoshikilia faili za vitambulisho. Akaunti inaweza kusoma kitambulisho chake kutoka kwenye faili iliyo ndani yake pekee, kamwe si faili ya ufunguo wa vault. Ikiwa tupu, ambayo ni chaguo-msingi, hukataa faili za vitambulisho. Msimamizi wa Cloud huchagua faili, kwa hivyo weka vitambulisho vya cloud pekee hapa."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collector"
msgstr "Kikusanyaji"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collector Time Budget"
msgstr "Bajeti ya Muda ya Kikusanyaji"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one collector run may spend before it stops starting new work. Keep it below the poller interval; unfinished accounts resume on the next run."
msgstr "Sekunde ambazo uendeshaji mmoja wa kikusanyaji unaweza kutumia kabla ya kuacha kuanzisha kazi mpya. Kiweke chini ya kipindi cha poller; akaunti ambazo hazijakamilika huendelea katika uendeshaji unaofuata."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Sakinusha"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Weka Majedwali ya Programu-jalizi Wakati wa Kusakinusha"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its accounts, encrypted credentials, and cache. Clear it to have the uninstall drop them. Cloud resources are never touched either way."
msgstr "Ikiteuliwa, kusakinusha programu-jalizi huhifadhi akaunti zake, vitambulisho vilivyosimbwa, na kache. Ondoa uteuzi ili usakinushaji uvifute. Rasilimali za cloud haziguswi kamwe kwa njia yoyote."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "Not verified yet."
msgstr "Bado haijathibitishwa."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The credential works and has the permissions this account needs."
msgstr "Kitambulisho kinafanya kazi na kina ruhusa ambazo akaunti hii inahitaji."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The provider rejected the credential. It may be wrong, expired, or revoked."
msgstr "Mtoa huduma alikataa kitambulisho. Huenda si sahihi, muda wake umeisha, au kimebatilishwa."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The credential works but lacks a permission this account needs."
msgstr "Kitambulisho kinafanya kazi lakini kinakosa ruhusa ambayo akaunti hii inahitaji."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The provider could not be reached. Check the network path and outbound policy from the poller."
msgstr "Mtoa huduma hakuweza kufikiwa. Angalia njia ya mtandao na sera ya kutoka nje kutoka kwa poller."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The provider is throttling requests. Try again later."
msgstr "Mtoa huduma anapunguza kasi ya maombi. Jaribu tena baadaye."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The provider sent a response the plugin could not read."
msgstr "Mtoa huduma alituma jibu ambalo programu-jalizi haikuweza kusoma."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The account or its credential is not configured correctly."
msgstr "Akaunti au kitambulisho chake hakijasanidiwa ipasavyo."

